[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_9999","text":"节目工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0010","text":"──好，OK！\n那开始检查画面了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0020","text":"……嗯。刚才那一遍，我觉得挺好的。\n大家觉得怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0030","text":"嗯，我没问题。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0040","text":"我也是……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0050","text":"…………\n只有最后──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0060","text":"好，画面稍微回放一下。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0080","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0090","text":"路加，你觉得呢？\n有什么在意的地方尽管说。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0100","text":"──没什么，就这样吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0110","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0120","text":"好的，谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0130","text":"──那就用刚才那一遍吧。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0140","text":"那么……今天的录制到此结束。\n大家辛苦了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0150","text":"嗯！／好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0160","text":"呼，太好了！\n谢谢你，阳希酱，路加──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0170","text":"路加酱！\n……已经要回去了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0180","text":"──……\n……还有什么事吗。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0190","text":"……啊，没有。\n不是那个意思──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_05_0200","text":"……辛苦了──"}]
